ffects={'A1':'Read barrier uses qualified quorum acknowledgments after a current-term commit','A2':'reset replaces readOnly acknowledgment tracker; pendingReadIndexMessages is not reset there'},unknowns=['Whether earlier pending messages surviving role changes create a separate resource or correlation responsibility','Configuration commit/read-release asymmetry has no established completion violation; caller retries are explicit counterevidence'])\nF=[]\ndef fact(i,meaning,identity,ctx,rep,ss,**kw):F.append(dict(id=i,meaning=meaning,identity=identity,validity_context=ctx,representation=rep,source_ids=ss,**kw))\nfact('F-authority','Local role and term identify the context in which this instance processes leader work',{'node':'raft.id','term':'raft.Term'},'Current role, election outcome and active configuration; not proof of current quorum reachability',['Term','Vote','state','lead'],['S-authority','S-dispatch','S-rolehandlers'],durability='Term/Vote persisted by caller; role and lead volatile',recovery='Startup becomes follower after loading HardState',invalidators=['B-election','B-transfer','B-config'],unknowns=[])\nfact('F-commit','Local committed index marks the accepted log prefix that may become available for ordered application',{'node':'raft.id','prefix':'log index and its retained term/history'},'Leader establishes through current-term quorum commit; follower through matching append, bounded heartbeat or committed snapshot; established prefix survives term changes',['raftLog.committed','HardState.Commit'],['S-commitguard','S-append','S-restore','S-config'],durability='HardState and log persisted by caller; in-memory commit can precede local write completion',recovery='Load persisted commit or restore snapshot',reinterpreters=['B-config'],unknowns=[])\nfact('F-config','The tracker holds the active voter and learner sets and whether joint configuration requests automatic exit',{'node':'raft.id','configuration':'incoming/outgoing voter sets, learners and AutoLea